                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Dry, coolest stretch · ~13–22°C</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Peak picking; best supply</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Busiest, esp. weekends</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Warm layer, light rain jacket</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Go early; book stays ahead</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top font-bold text-ink">Mar – May</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Dry, warmer · ~15–25°C</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Strong picking; festival month</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">High around festival dates</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Sun protection, water</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Check festival schedule first</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top font-bold text-ink">Jun – Aug</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Wet season · ~15–23°C</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Lighter supply; greener fields</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Calmer, fewer queues</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Reliable rain gear</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Aim for a clear morning window</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top font-bold text-ink">Sep – Oct</td>
                    <td class="px-5 py-4 align-top text-soil-700">Wet-to-dry shift · ~14–23°C</td>
