          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-xs leading-5 text-soil-700">Typical ranges are drawn from Philippine highland climate norms (cool, wet June–Oct, dry Nov–May). Actual temperature, rain and harvest volume vary year to year with weather and farm rotation.</p>
