          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-soil-700">Three tailored routes by who is travelling, plus two standard loops you can mix and match.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-soil-700/12 bg-white/55 p-7 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]">
