      <section id="science" class="border-y border-soil-700/10 bg-white/45 py-16 lg:py-24" aria-labelledby="science-heading">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 lg:px-8">
          <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-berry-600">Field notes</p>
              <h2 id="science-heading" class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Why this valley grows strawberries</h2>
              <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-soil-700">La Trinidad sits at cool upland elevation in Benguet, a climate that suits <strong class="font-bold text-ink">short-day strawberry varieties</strong> — the type that forms fruit as days shorten and nights cool. That is the simple agronomy behind the town’s “strawberry capital” identity.</p>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-soil-700">The crop is grown in raised beds and rotated through the year, so not every row is ready at once. Picking windows, supply and price all move with the weather and the planting calendar — which is why a guide can only point you to the right questions, not a fixed daily rate.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[2.2rem] border border-soil-700/12 bg-cream p-8 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]">
              <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">Visitor responsibility</h3>
              <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-soil-700">
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-berry-600">●</span><span>Follow the grower’s instructions and pick only where picking is allowed.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-berry-600">●</span><span>Choose fully red fruit and handle plants gently so beds stay productive.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-berry-600">●</span><span>Carry small cash and confirm the day’s price before you start.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-berry-600">●</span><span>Take your wrappers and plastics with you; bins are limited near the rows.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-berry-600">●</span><span>Respect private plots, other visitors and local traffic on narrow farm roads.</span></li>
                <li class="flex gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-berry-600">●</span><span>Treat the Giant Strawberry Cake as town heritage, not a daily on-site exhibit.</span></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

